{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;stream_event&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;content_block_start&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:2,&quot;content_block&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;tool_use&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toolu_017d9G7QGysAf5t1WXcZK7N1&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Bash&quot;,&quot;input&quot;:{},&quot;caller&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;direct&quot;}}},&quot;session_id&quot;:&quot;2362363f-8820-4231-8b92-862af8c3e7f0&quot;,&quot;parent_tool_use_id&quot;:null,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;aab6a2e0-326d-4e37-b141-7cb95535333f&quot;}
{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;stream_event&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;content_block_delta&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:2,&quot;delta&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;input_json_delta&quot;,&quot;partial_json&quot;:&quot;&quot;}},&quot;session_id&quot;:&quot;2362363f-8820-4231-8b92-862af8c3e7f0&quot;,&quot;parent_tool_use_id&quot;:null,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d2c74f16-42ec-4529-99cc-afa1a31fce1d&quot;}
{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;stream_event&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;content_block_delta&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:2,&quot;delta&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;input_json_delta&quot;,&quot;partial_json&quot;:&quot;{\&quot;command\&quot;: \&quot;cd /Users/pksoftware/workspace-fh/blockml &amp;&amp; echo \\\&quot;=== running T00036 ===\\\&quot; &amp;&amp; cat&quot;}},&quot;session_id&quot;:&quot;2362363f-8820-4231-8b92-862af8c3e7f0&quot;,&quot;parent_tool_use_id&quot;:null,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0b5756e9-e428-453f-944f-64eff6902cfc&quot;}
{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;message&quot;:{&quot;role&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:[{&quot;tool_use_id&quot;:&quot;toolu_01LdeBuGF4cQqfirgD4doHRi&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;tool_result&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;=== playground dir ===\ntotal 16\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 4 pksoftware  staff   128 Sep  7 22:14 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 8 pksoftware  staff   256 Sep  7 22:09 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 pksoftware  staff  2963 Sep  7 22:19 MyTestTransformation.bml\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 pksoftware  staff  2783 Sep  7 22:19 RandomBlock.bml\n=== RandomBlock.bml ===\n&lt;!--Workspace Playground — RandomBlock\n  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.RandomBlock-->\n&lt;playground:RandomBlock xmlns=\&quot;http://blockml.org/bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:core=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.core\&quot;\n  xmlns:type=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.type\&quot;\n  xmlns:playground=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground\&quot;>\n\n  &lt;baseType>\n    core:Documentation\n  &lt;/baseType>\n  &lt;is>\n    A midnight lending shelf of bicycle lamps outside an all-night bakery, where riders borrow a light and leave a coin or a warm roll in its place\n  &lt;/is>\n  &lt;documentation>\n    Produced by the \&quot;Create Random Block\&quot; step of playground:MyTestTransformation\n    during a BlockML workspace transform execution. Each run discards whatever\n    stood here before and writes freshly invented, arbitrary material, so none\n    of the names, numbers, or dates below are stable or authoritative.\n  &lt;/documentation>\n  &lt;properties>\n    &lt;title type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>The Lamp Shelf at Håkonsen's Night Bakery&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/title>\n    &lt;custodian type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>Minded by Trine Håkonsen, who bakes from two in the morning and clips fresh batteries into the lamps while the first loaves prove&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/custodian>\n    &lt;location type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>A weatherboarded bakery on Sildegata, one street back from the fish quay, where the harbour wind funnels between the ice plant and the chandlery&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/location>\n    &lt;summary type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>A pine shelf bolted beside the bakery door holds a row of red rear lamps and white front lamps, each on a short brass hook. The rule, chalked on a slate, is: take a lamp if yours has died, ride home safe, and bring it back within three nights or leave something for the tin — coins, a candle, or a roll still warm from your own kitchen. A ship's logbook on a chain records the lamp taken, the street it is headed for, and whether the borrower wants waking with a knock if it is not returned. Dock workers, nurses on the late shift, and one accordion teacher keep the shelf turning over; twice a winter the whole row goes out at once and Trine rides the streets at dawn collecting them back.&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/summary>\n    &lt;lampsOnTheShelfTonight type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>18&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/lampsOnTheShelfTonight>\n    &lt;loansLoggedThisMonth type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>204&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/loansLoggedThisMonth>\n    &lt;coinsInTheTin type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>1375&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/coinsInTheTin>\n    &lt;shelfLengthCentimetres type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>142&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/shelfLengthCentimetres>\n    &lt;recordedAt type=\&quot;type:DateTime\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>2026-09-07T22:16:33&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/recordedAt>\n    &lt;shelfMountedOn type=\&quot;type:DateTime\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>2021-02-17T04:05:00&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/shelfMountedOn>\n  &lt;/properties>\n&lt;/playground:RandomBlock>\n=== MyTestTransformation.bml ===\n&lt;!--Workspace Playground — MyTestTransformation\n  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.MyTestTransformation-->\n&lt;playground:MyTestTransformation xmlns=\&quot;http://blockml.org/bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:core=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.core\&quot;\n  xmlns:workflow=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.transformer.workflow\&quot;\n  xmlns:type=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.type\&quot;\n  xmlns:playground=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground\&quot;>\n\n  &lt;baseType>\n    workflow:ModelTransformation(playground:MyTestTransformation.Parameters, type:Text)\n  &lt;/baseType>\n  &lt;is>\n    A pending ModelTransformation that creates a random playground Block\n  &lt;/is>\n  &lt;properties>\n    &lt;description override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>A transformation that creates a random playground Block&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/description>\n    &lt;status override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;workflow:ExecutionStatus\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>Pending&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/status>\n    &lt;createdAt override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;type:DateTime\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>2026-09-06T00:00:00&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/createdAt>\n    &lt;template override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;type:Boolean\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>true&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/template>\n    &lt;parameters override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;playground:MyTestTransformation.Parameters\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>{targetBlock:\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.RandomBlock\&quot;}&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/parameters>\n  &lt;/properties>\n  &lt;aggregations>\n    &lt;operations override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;workflow:AgenticOperation name=\&quot;Create Random Block\&quot; status=\&quot;Pending\&quot; captureOutput=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n          &lt;task>\n            &lt;workflow:InstructionTask>\n              &lt;instructions>Create or update the block \${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }\nas a random Block under the playground package.\nFor each execution invent fresh, arbitrary content so the\nblock differs from any previous run.\nThe block must be a complete and valid BML Block:\n- name — the short name of \${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }\n- type — \${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }\n- baseType — core:Documentation\n- is — a one-line description of the random content\n- documentation — a short paragraph noting it was produced by\n  this transform execution\n- a handful of typed properties (type:Text, type:Integer,\n  type:DateTime) carrying the random content, including a\n  date (type:DateTime) set to now\nWrite only under the playground package. Do not edit\nModelTransformation metadata or files under _meta/transform/.&lt;/instructions>\n            &lt;/workflow:InstructionTask>\n          &lt;/task>\n        &lt;/workflow:AgenticOperation>\n        &lt;workflow:ToolOperation name=\&quot;Validate\&quot; status=\&quot;Pending\&quot; captureOutput=\&quot;true\&quot; command=\&quot;blockml\&quot;>\n          &lt;args>[&amp;quot;validate&amp;quot;]&lt;/args>\n        &lt;/workflow:ToolOperation>\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/operations>\n  &lt;/aggregations>\n  &lt;subBlocks>\n    &lt;Parameters>\n      &lt;baseType>\n        type:StructType\n      &lt;/baseType>\n      &lt;is>\n        Run parameters for this random block transformation\n      &lt;/is>\n      &lt;properties>\n        &lt;targetBlock type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot; />\n      &lt;/properties>\n    &lt;/Parameters>\n  &lt;/subBlocks>\n&lt;/playground:MyTestTransformation>\n=== Library.bml ===\n&lt;!--BlockML Workspace Library\n  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.Library-->\n&lt;workspace:Library xmlns=\&quot;http://blockml.org/bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:blockml=\&quot;org.blockml.bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:bom=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.bom\&quot;\n  xmlns:builder=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.builder\&quot;\n  xmlns:cli=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.cli\&quot;\n  xmlns:parser=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.parser\&quot;\n  xmlns:runtime=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.runtime\&quot;\n  xmlns:serializer=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.serializer\&quot;\n  xmlns:validator=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.validator\&quot;\n  xmlns:core=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.core\&quot;\n  xmlns:def=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.definition\&quot;\n  xmlns:framework=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.framework\&quot;\n  xmlns:graph=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.graph\&quot;\n  xmlns:inspect=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.inspect\&quot;\n  xmlns:search=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.search\&quot;\n  xmlns:blockdoc=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.target.blockdoc\&quot;\n  xmlns:fatblock=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.target.fatblock\&quot;\n  xmlns:xsd=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.target.xsd\&quot;\n  xmlns:transformer=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.transformer\&quot;\n  xmlns:type=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.type\&quot;\n  xmlns:workspace=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace\&quot;\n  xmlns:wsdocumentation=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.documentation\&quot;>\n\n  &lt;baseType>\n    core:BlockLibrary\n  &lt;/baseType>\n  &lt;is>\n    The BlockML monorepo workspace library catalog\n  &lt;/is>\n  &lt;version>\n    0.9.4\n  &lt;/version>\n  &lt;documentation>\n    Documentation and SSOT hub for the BlockML toolchain monorepo. Links package\n    BML libraries (workspace → packages only). Membership is defined exclusively\n    by this blocks list. Package libraries must not depend back on this library.\n  &lt;/documentation>\n  &lt;language>\n    &lt;blockml:language.English />\n  &lt;/language>\n  &lt;properties>\n    &lt;description override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>BlockML workspace monorepo library&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/description>\n  &lt;/properties>\n  &lt;aggregations>\n    &lt;readMe override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;workspace:README />\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/readMe>\n    &lt;dependencies override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;blockml:Library />\n        &lt;bom:Library />\n        &lt;builder:Library />\n        &lt;blockdoc:Library />\n        &lt;cli:Library />\n        &lt;fatblock:Library />\n        &lt;framework:Library />\n        &lt;graph:Library />\n        &lt;inspect:Library />\n        &lt;parser:Library />\n        &lt;runtime:Library />\n        &lt;search:Library />\n        &lt;serializer:Library />\n        &lt;transformer:Library />\n        &lt;validator:Library />\n        &lt;xsd:Library />\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/dependencies>\n    &lt;blocks override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;workspace:WorkspaceType />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:Introduction />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:PackageMap />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:ArchitectureOverview />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:ReadingOrder />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:LinkingRules />\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/blocks>\n  &lt;/aggregations>\n&lt;/workspace:Library>&quot;,&quot;is_error&quot;:false}]},&quot;parent_tool_use_id&quot;:null,&quot;session_id&quot;:&quot;2362363f-8820-4231-8b92-862af8c3e7f0&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;683bb4ba-85d9-48b4-83a3-58baddd251e2&quot;,&quot;timestamp&quot;:&quot;2026-09-07T20:21:02.008Z&quot;,&quot;tool_use_result&quot;:{&quot;stdout&quot;:&quot;=== playground dir ===\ntotal 16\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 4 pksoftware  staff   128 Sep  7 22:14 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 8 pksoftware  staff   256 Sep  7 22:09 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 pksoftware  staff  2963 Sep  7 22:19 MyTestTransformation.bml\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 pksoftware  staff  2783 Sep  7 22:19 RandomBlock.bml\n=== RandomBlock.bml ===\n&lt;!--Workspace Playground — RandomBlock\n  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.RandomBlock-->\n&lt;playground:RandomBlock xmlns=\&quot;http://blockml.org/bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:core=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.core\&quot;\n  xmlns:type=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.type\&quot;\n  xmlns:playground=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground\&quot;>\n\n  &lt;baseType>\n    core:Documentation\n  &lt;/baseType>\n  &lt;is>\n    A midnight lending shelf of bicycle lamps outside an all-night bakery, where riders borrow a light and leave a coin or a warm roll in its place\n  &lt;/is>\n  &lt;documentation>\n    Produced by the \&quot;Create Random Block\&quot; step of playground:MyTestTransformation\n    during a BlockML workspace transform execution. Each run discards whatever\n    stood here before and writes freshly invented, arbitrary material, so none\n    of the names, numbers, or dates below are stable or authoritative.\n  &lt;/documentation>\n  &lt;properties>\n    &lt;title type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>The Lamp Shelf at Håkonsen's Night Bakery&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/title>\n    &lt;custodian type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>Minded by Trine Håkonsen, who bakes from two in the morning and clips fresh batteries into the lamps while the first loaves prove&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/custodian>\n    &lt;location type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>A weatherboarded bakery on Sildegata, one street back from the fish quay, where the harbour wind funnels between the ice plant and the chandlery&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/location>\n    &lt;summary type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>A pine shelf bolted beside the bakery door holds a row of red rear lamps and white front lamps, each on a short brass hook. The rule, chalked on a slate, is: take a lamp if yours has died, ride home safe, and bring it back within three nights or leave something for the tin — coins, a candle, or a roll still warm from your own kitchen. A ship's logbook on a chain records the lamp taken, the street it is headed for, and whether the borrower wants waking with a knock if it is not returned. Dock workers, nurses on the late shift, and one accordion teacher keep the shelf turning over; twice a winter the whole row goes out at once and Trine rides the streets at dawn collecting them back.&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/summary>\n    &lt;lampsOnTheShelfTonight type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>18&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/lampsOnTheShelfTonight>\n    &lt;loansLoggedThisMonth type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>204&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/loansLoggedThisMonth>\n    &lt;coinsInTheTin type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>1375&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/coinsInTheTin>\n    &lt;shelfLengthCentimetres type=\&quot;type:Integer\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>142&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/shelfLengthCentimetres>\n    &lt;recordedAt type=\&quot;type:DateTime\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>2026-09-07T22:16:33&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/recordedAt>\n    &lt;shelfMountedOn type=\&quot;type:DateTime\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>2021-02-17T04:05:00&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/shelfMountedOn>\n  &lt;/properties>\n&lt;/playground:RandomBlock>\n=== MyTestTransformation.bml ===\n&lt;!--Workspace Playground — MyTestTransformation\n  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.MyTestTransformation-->\n&lt;playground:MyTestTransformation xmlns=\&quot;http://blockml.org/bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:core=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.core\&quot;\n  xmlns:workflow=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.transformer.workflow\&quot;\n  xmlns:type=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.type\&quot;\n  xmlns:playground=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground\&quot;>\n\n  &lt;baseType>\n    workflow:ModelTransformation(playground:MyTestTransformation.Parameters, type:Text)\n  &lt;/baseType>\n  &lt;is>\n    A pending ModelTransformation that creates a random playground Block\n  &lt;/is>\n  &lt;properties>\n    &lt;description override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>A transformation that creates a random playground Block&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/description>\n    &lt;status override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;workflow:ExecutionStatus\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>Pending&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/status>\n    &lt;createdAt override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;type:DateTime\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>2026-09-06T00:00:00&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/createdAt>\n    &lt;template override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;type:Boolean\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>true&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/template>\n    &lt;parameters override=\&quot;true\&quot; type=\&quot;playground:MyTestTransformation.Parameters\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>{targetBlock:\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.RandomBlock\&quot;}&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/parameters>\n  &lt;/properties>\n  &lt;aggregations>\n    &lt;operations override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;workflow:AgenticOperation name=\&quot;Create Random Block\&quot; status=\&quot;Pending\&quot; captureOutput=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n          &lt;task>\n            &lt;workflow:InstructionTask>\n              &lt;instructions>Create or update the block \${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }\nas a random Block under the playground package.\nFor each execution invent fresh, arbitrary content so the\nblock differs from any previous run.\nThe block must be a complete and valid BML Block:\n- name — the short name of \${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }\n- type — \${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }\n- baseType — core:Documentation\n- is — a one-line description of the random content\n- documentation — a short paragraph noting it was produced by\n  this transform execution\n- a handful of typed properties (type:Text, type:Integer,\n  type:DateTime) carrying the random content, including a\n  date (type:DateTime) set to now\nWrite only under the playground package. Do not edit\nModelTransformation metadata or files under _meta/transform/.&lt;/instructions>\n            &lt;/workflow:InstructionTask>\n          &lt;/task>\n        &lt;/workflow:AgenticOperation>\n        &lt;workflow:ToolOperation name=\&quot;Validate\&quot; status=\&quot;Pending\&quot; captureOutput=\&quot;true\&quot; command=\&quot;blockml\&quot;>\n          &lt;args>[&amp;quot;validate&amp;quot;]&lt;/args>\n        &lt;/workflow:ToolOperation>\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/operations>\n  &lt;/aggregations>\n  &lt;subBlocks>\n    &lt;Parameters>\n      &lt;baseType>\n        type:StructType\n      &lt;/baseType>\n      &lt;is>\n        Run parameters for this random block transformation\n      &lt;/is>\n      &lt;properties>\n        &lt;targetBlock type=\&quot;type:Text\&quot; />\n      &lt;/properties>\n    &lt;/Parameters>\n  &lt;/subBlocks>\n&lt;/playground:MyTestTransformation>\n=== Library.bml ===\n&lt;!--BlockML Workspace Library\n  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.Library-->\n&lt;workspace:Library xmlns=\&quot;http://blockml.org/bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:blockml=\&quot;org.blockml.bml\&quot;\n  xmlns:bom=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.bom\&quot;\n  xmlns:builder=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.builder\&quot;\n  xmlns:cli=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.cli\&quot;\n  xmlns:parser=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.parser\&quot;\n  xmlns:runtime=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.runtime\&quot;\n  xmlns:serializer=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.serializer\&quot;\n  xmlns:validator=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.compiler.validator\&quot;\n  xmlns:core=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.core\&quot;\n  xmlns:def=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.definition\&quot;\n  xmlns:framework=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.framework\&quot;\n  xmlns:graph=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.graph\&quot;\n  xmlns:inspect=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.inspect\&quot;\n  xmlns:search=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.search\&quot;\n  xmlns:blockdoc=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.target.blockdoc\&quot;\n  xmlns:fatblock=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.target.fatblock\&quot;\n  xmlns:xsd=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.target.xsd\&quot;\n  xmlns:transformer=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.transformer\&quot;\n  xmlns:type=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.type\&quot;\n  xmlns:workspace=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace\&quot;\n  xmlns:wsdocumentation=\&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.documentation\&quot;>\n\n  &lt;baseType>\n    core:BlockLibrary\n  &lt;/baseType>\n  &lt;is>\n    The BlockML monorepo workspace library catalog\n  &lt;/is>\n  &lt;version>\n    0.9.4\n  &lt;/version>\n  &lt;documentation>\n    Documentation and SSOT hub for the BlockML toolchain monorepo. Links package\n    BML libraries (workspace → packages only). Membership is defined exclusively\n    by this blocks list. Package libraries must not depend back on this library.\n  &lt;/documentation>\n  &lt;language>\n    &lt;blockml:language.English />\n  &lt;/language>\n  &lt;properties>\n    &lt;description override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;value>BlockML workspace monorepo library&lt;/value>\n    &lt;/description>\n  &lt;/properties>\n  &lt;aggregations>\n    &lt;readMe override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;workspace:README />\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/readMe>\n    &lt;dependencies override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;blockml:Library />\n        &lt;bom:Library />\n        &lt;builder:Library />\n        &lt;blockdoc:Library />\n        &lt;cli:Library />\n        &lt;fatblock:Library />\n        &lt;framework:Library />\n        &lt;graph:Library />\n        &lt;inspect:Library />\n        &lt;parser:Library />\n        &lt;runtime:Library />\n        &lt;search:Library />\n        &lt;serializer:Library />\n        &lt;transformer:Library />\n        &lt;validator:Library />\n        &lt;xsd:Library />\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/dependencies>\n    &lt;blocks override=\&quot;true\&quot;>\n      &lt;composition>\n        &lt;workspace:WorkspaceType />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:Introduction />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:PackageMap />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:ArchitectureOverview />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:ReadingOrder />\n        &lt;wsdocumentation:LinkingRules />\n      &lt;/composition>\n    &lt;/blocks>\n  &lt;/aggregations>\n&lt;/workspace:Library>&quot;,&quot;stderr&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;interrupted&quot;:false,&quot;isImage&quot;:false,&quot;noOutputExpected&quot;:false}}
