{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;message&quot;:{&quot;role&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:[{&quot;tool_use_id&quot;:&quot;toolu_01UPvwuVpu98uFXuc24N1aVo&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;tool_result&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;warning BML_STYLE_LEGACY_BLOCK_WRAPPER /Users/pksoftware/workspace-fh/blockml/packages/bom/blocks/org/blockml/bml/bom/documentation/ValidationResponsibilities.bml:5 — Prefer a type-or-name tag instead of the legacy block wrapper.\nwarning BML_STYLE_LEGACY_BLOCK_WRAPPER /Users/pksoftware/workspace-fh/blockml/packages/framework/blocks/org/blockml/bml/framework/documentation/ConstraintValidation.bml:5 — Prefer a type-or-name tag instead of the legacy block wrapper.\nwarning BML_STYLE_LEGACY_BLOCK_WRAPPER /Users/pksoftware/workspace-fh/blockml/packages/validator/blocks/org/blockml/bml/compiler/validator/documentation/ValidationPipeline.bml:5 — Prefer a type-or-name tag instead of the legacy block wrapper.\nValidation succeeded. Tested 753 blocks, 0 with errors, 699 warnings, 5 recommendations.\nexit=0\n{\n  \&quot;root\&quot;: \&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.MyLatestStory\&quot;,\n  \&quot;depth\&quot;: 1,\n  \&quot;blocks\&quot;: {\n    \&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.MyLatestStory\&quot;: {\n      \&quot;fqn\&quot;: \&quot;org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.MyLatestStory\&quot;,\n      \&quot;name\&quot;: \&quot;MyLatestStory\&quot;,\n      \&quot;file\&quot;: \&quot;blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/MyLatestStory.bml\&quot;,\n      \&quot;origin\&quot;: \&quot;workspace\&quot;,\n      \&quot;is\&quot;: \&quot;A random structured song produced by a workspace transform execution, in Spanish, about a futuristic city and a dog\&quot;,\n      \&quot;documentation\&quot;: \&quot;Produced by the \\\&quot;Create Poem\\\&quot; step of a BlockML workspace transform execution.\\nEach run discards whatever stood here before and writes a freshly composed\\nSpanish song about a futuristic city and a dog, carried as typed properties,\\nso none of the text below is stable or authoritative.\&quot;,\n      \&quot;baseType\&quot;: {\n        \&quot;kind\&quot;: \&quot;named\&quot;,\n        \&quot;ref\&quot;: \&quot;org.blockml.bml.core.Documentation\&quot;\n      },\n      \&quot;ancestors\&quot;: [\n        \&quot;org.blockml.bml.core.Block\&quot;,\n        \&quot;org.blockml.bml.core.Documentation\&quot;\n      ],\n      \&quot;properties\&quot;: [\n        {\n          \&quot;name\&quot;: \&quot;title\&quot;,\n          \&quot;visibility\&quot;: \&quot;public\&quot;,\n          \&quot;type\&quot;: {\n            \&quot;kind\&quot;: \&quot;named\&quot;,\n            \&quot;ref\&quot;: \&quot;org.blockml.bml.type.Text\&quot;\n          },\n          \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;El can de la Avenida de Cristal\&quot;\n        },\n        {\n          \&quot;name\&quot;: \&quot;artist\&quot;,\n          \&quot;visibility\&quot;: \&quot;public\&quot;,\n          \&quot;type\&quot;: {\n            \&quot;kind\&quot;: \&quot;named\&quot;,\n            \&quot;ref\&quot;: \&quot;org.blockml.bml.type.Text\&quot;\n          },\n          \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;Los Faroles de Neón\&quot;\n        },\n        {\n          \&quot;name\&quot;: \&quot;song\&quot;,\n          \&quot;visibility\&quot;: \&quot;public\&quot;,\n          \&quot;type\&quot;: {\n            \&quot;kind\&quot;: \&quot;named\&quot;,\n            \&quot;ref\&quot;: \&quot;org.blockml.bml.type.Text\&quot;\n          },\n          \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;(Estrofa 1)\\nLa ciudad se levanta sobre rieles de vidrio,\\nmil ventanas encendidas como ojos sin sueño,\\ny en la plaza de acero, donde nadie pasea,\\nun perro gris olfatea lo que el viento trajo.\\n\\n(Estrofa 2)\\nNo lleva collar, ni número, ni dueño que lo llame,\\nsolo el mapa de las calles guardado en su nariz;\\nlos coches vuelan mudos, las farolas quieren hablar,\\npero él persigue el eco de una vieja cicatriz.\\n\\n(Estribillo)\\nCorre, can, corre, bajo el cielo de neón,\\nque la Torre Nueve todavía tiene voz;\\nsi el futuro es una máquina sin sitio para el corazón,\\ntú serás el guardián de lo que fuimos los dos.\\n\\n(Estrofa 3)\\nUn niño lo saluda desde un puente de titanio,\\nle lanza un pan de luz que sabe a lluvia de verdad,\\ny el perro mueve la cola como un péndulo de agua,\\nmidiendo con su alegría la distancia a la ciudad.\\n\\n(Estribillo)\\nCorre, can, corre, bajo el cielo de neón,\\nque la Torre Nueve todavía tiene voz;\\nsi el futuro es una máquina sin sitio para el corazón,\\ntú serás el guardián de lo que fuimos los dos.\\n\\n(Puente)\\nCuando se apaguen las pantallas y el ascensor se duerma,\\ncuando el último dron regrese a su rincón,\\nquedará su silueta recortada en el vapor,\\nun latido analógico en mitad del procesador.\\n\\n(Final)\\nLa ciudad se levanta sobre rieles de vidrio,\\ny a sus pies late tibio un pequeño corazón;\\nmañana habrá más torres, más silencio, más metal,\\npero siempre habrá un perro cuidando la canción.\&quot;\n        },\n        {\n          \&quot;name\&quot;: \&quot;language\&quot;,\n          \&quot;visibility\&quot;: \&quot;public\&quot;,\n          \&quot;type\&quot;: {\n            \&quot;kind\&quot;: \&quot;named\&quot;,\n            \&quot;ref\&quot;: \&quot;org.blockml.bml.type.Text\&quot;\n          },\n          \&quot;value\&quot;: \&quot;Spanish\&quot;\n        },\n        {\n          \&quot;name\&quot;: \&quot;date\&quot;,\n          \&quot;visibility\&quot;: \&quot;public\&quot;,\n          \&quot;type\&quot;: {&quot;,&quot;is_error&quot;:false}]},&quot;parent_tool_use_id&quot;:null,&quot;session_id&quot;:&quot;2362363f-8820-4231-8b92-862af8c3e7f0&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;a2238fd7-5274-4da1-95d1-19531fc250ff&quot;,&quot;timestamp&quot;:&quot;2026-09-07T20:22:03.183Z&quot;,&quot;tool_use_result&quot;:{&quot;stdout&quot;:&quot;warning BML_STYLE_LEGACY_BLOCK_WRAPPER /Users/pksoftware/workspace-fh/blockml/packages/bom/blocks/org/blockml/bml/b